cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use cuju-render in your research, please cite cuju and Google Research Football.
title: "cuju-render: the browser renderer of cuju"
type: software
authors:
    - family-names: Koraleski
      given-names: André
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-11"
license:
    - Apache-2.0
    - MIT
    - CC0-1.0
    - Unlicense
    - CC-BY-4.0
url: https://github.com/AndreKoraleski/cuju-render
repository-code: https://github.com/AndreKoraleski/cuju-render
abstract: >-
    cuju-render shows the matches of cuju, a bit-exact, batched reimplementation of Google Research
    Football, in a browser in three dimensions with sound, saved and live, and leaves every output
    of the batch as it would be unwatched.
keywords:
    - reinforcement learning
    - google research football
    - visualization
